                    {
                      "type": "markdown",
                      "content": "{% set mode = states('sensor.energyhub_operating_mode') | lower %}\n{% set mode_names = {'solar':'Solar First','hybrid_charging':'Legacy recovery · charging','hybrid_grid_hold':'Legacy recovery · grid hold','panic':'Battery Reserve · charging','panic_grid_hold':'Battery Reserve · grid hold','transitioning':'Changing Strategy','transition_failed':'Strategy Change Failed'} %}\n{% set descriptions = {'solar':'Solar and battery are preferred above the release threshold.','hybrid_charging':'A persisted legacy state is being transferred to Battery Reserve control.','hybrid_grid_hold':'A persisted legacy state is being transferred to Battery Reserve control.','panic':'Grid charging is enabled to restore the applied reserve.','panic_grid_hold':'The house uses grid supply while the applied reserve is protected.'} %}\n## {{ mode_names.get(mode, 'Strategy unavailable') }}\n**Strategy:** {{ mode_names.get(mode, 'Unknown') }}  \n**Applied Battery Reserve:** {{ states('input_number.ahm_minimum_soc') | float(20) | round(0) }}%  \n{% if states('sensor.energyhub_telemetry_freshness') == 'fresh' and (mode == 'solar' or states('sensor.powmr_10_2m_grid_voltage') | float(0) > 180) %}{{ descriptions.get(mode, 'Waiting for a confirmed strategy.') }}{% endif %}\n{% if states('sensor.energyhub_telemetry_freshness') != 'fresh' %}⚠️ Telemetry is not fresh; actual supply and charging are unconfirmed.\n{% elif states('sensor.powmr_10_2m_grid_voltage') | float(0) <= 180 and mode != 'solar' %}⚠️ Grid supply is unavailable; the selected strategy is not proof of current charging.\n{% endif %}**Reason:** {{ states('sensor.energyhub_operating_mode_reason') }}"
